Source offer (Illustration Renderer Pack)
=========================================

If you redistribute a **modified** Blender binary with this pack, you must
provide corresponding source under the GPL.

For **unmodified official** Blender builds obtained from blender.org, pointing
users at https://www.blender.org/download/ and the matching source archives
published by the Blender Foundation is the intended information path.

Adapter scripts in `adapters/` are included in this tree in source form.

This file is an engineering placeholder — public redistribution still needs
OSS counsel review (see P0-C checklist).
